  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个Serilum模组。充满爱意打造。针对Fabric、Forge和Neo有大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于此模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">附魔等级上限指示器是一个客户端模组，帮助玩家判断物品上的附魔是否已达到最大等级。虽然经验丰富的玩家能记住每个等级的上限，但新冒险者则不行。当附魔等级达到最大潜力时，会在其旁边放置一个符号。默认使用金色星形，但你可以在配置中更改为你喜欢的内容。<br><br>在附魔台、铁砧以及物品提示框中均可工作。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 原生体验\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"环境：客户端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>maxLevelSymbol</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 \"⭐\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">用于表示附魔已达最高等级的符号。默认为星形。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>maxLevelSymbolColourIndex</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 6，最小 0，最大 15</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">最高等级符号使用的颜色索引值。可能值；0: 黑色, 1: 深蓝, 2: 深绿, 3: 深青, 4: 深红, 5: 深紫, 6: 金色, 7: 灰色, 8: 深灰, 9: 蓝色, 10: 绿色, 11: 青色, 12: 红色, 13: 淡紫, 14: 黄色, 15: 白色</span><br><br></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>轻松查看工具上哪些附魔已达最大值！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/max-enchantment-indicator/a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">星号标记已达最大值的附魔：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/max-enchantment-indicator/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在附魔提示旁显示符号：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/max-enchantment-indicator/c.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在铁砧中也有效：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/max-enchantment-indicator/d.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>不喜欢星形？使用你自己的自定义符号和颜色！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/max-enchantment-indicator/e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内，你可自由将此模组用于任何模组包。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览与更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论功能已禁用，因我无法在众多独立模组页面中跟踪评论。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如需报告问题、提出建议或任何其他需求，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github仓库</a>。感谢支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
